
---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Home"
  description="BlueGate Labs develops practical software applications, cybersecurity tools and applied technology research in Australia."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">INDEPENDENT AUSTRALIAN DEVELOPMENT</p>

    <h1>BlueGate Labs</h1>

    <h2>Software Engineering & Cybersecurity</h2>

    <p class="intro">
      Building practical software solutions, security technologies
      and intelligent automation to solve real-world problems.
    </p>

    <p>
      BlueGate Labs combines independent software development with
      hands-on cybersecurity engineering and research. Our focus
      is on useful applications, reliable technology and continuous
      improvement.
    </p>
  </section>

  <hr />

  <section aria-labelledby="divisions-heading">
    <h2 id="divisions-heading">What We Do</h2>

    <div class="division-grid">
      <article class="division-card">
        <p class="division-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌘</p>
        <h3>Software Development</h3>

        <p>
          Applications designed to simplify everyday tasks,
          manage information and improve productivity.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>PantryPal — Food inventory management</li>
          <li>NDIS Administration — Planned</li>
          <li>Scrapbook — Planned</li>
          <li>Receipt & Warranty Management — Planned</li>
        </ul>

        <a href="/projects">Explore Software Projects →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="division-card">
        <p class="division-icon" aria-hidden="true">◇</p>
        <h3>Cybersecurity</h3>

        <p>
          Security engineering, threat detection, cloud security,
          automation and practical technical research.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>BlueGate Security Monitor</li>
          <li>Reconnaissance Automation</li>
          <li>Active Directory Security Labs</li>
          <li>Technical Research & Articles</li>
        </ul>

        <a href="/projects">Explore Security Projects →</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr />

  <section aria-labelledby="featured-heading">
    <h2 id="featured-heading">Featured Projects</h2>

    <div class="featured-grid">
      <article class="project-card">
        <h3>PantryPal</h3>
        <p class="status">Closed Testing</p>
        <p>
          Android food inventory and expiry management,
          with receipt processing and shopping list features.
        </p>
        <a href="/projects/pantrypal">View Project →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card">
        <h3>BlueGate Security Monitor</h3>
        <p class="status">In Development</p>
        <p>
          Windows security monitoring using Sysmon telemetry,
          behavioural detection and persistent alert records.
        </p>
        <a href="/projects/bluegate">View Project →</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr />

  <section aria-labelledby="research-heading">
    <h2 id="research-heading">Research & Development</h2>

    <p>
      Our technical work explores detection engineering,
      Active Directory security, AWS cloud security,
      reconnaissance automation and network analysis.
    </p>

    <p>
      Upcoming research: Understanding LLMNR Poisoning
      with Responder — Lessons from a Windows 10/11 Lab.
    </p>

    <a href="/articles">Explore Research Articles →</a>
  </section>

  <style>
    .hero {
  padding: 1rem 0 0;
}


.hero {
  padding: 0.5rem 0 0;
}

.hero p:last-child {
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

.hero + hr {
  margin-top: 1.25rem;
}

.eyebrow {
  color: #93c5fd;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}


.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
  margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
}

.hero h2 {
  color: #f8fafc;
  font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.6rem);
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}

.intro {
  font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.4vw, 1.15rem);
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: #cbd5e1;
  max-width: 850px;
}

.division-card h3 {
  font-size: 1.125rem;
}



    .division-grid,
    .featured-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .division-card {
      background: #111c32;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    
.division-card h3 {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
}

.division-icon {
  color: #60a5fa;
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
}


    .division-card ul {
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .division-card a {
      margin-top: auto;
    }

    .status {
      color: #cbd5e1;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .division-card a,
    .project-card a,
    section > a {
      color: #93c5fd;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .division-card a:hover,
    .project-card a:hover,
    section > a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .division-grid,
      .featured-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .hero {
        padding-top: 0.5rem;
      }

      .division-card {
        padding: 1.25rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Layout>

